      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(12^2 = 144\\) and \\(13^2 = 169,\\) and \\(144 \\lt 164 \\lt 169,\\) the value \\(\\sqrt{164}\\) lies between \\(12\\) and \\(13.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
